Development website
-------------------
The optional website uses Astro. Its existing demo animation derives from
the upstream project and illustrates features; it is not a recording of the
current native Captures build. The optional demo source uses React and
Remotion; consult those packages' licenses before rendering or distributing
new video output. These tools are not native app dependencies.

